  <data name="Exp_Heading" xml:space="preserve"><value>What can be reached from outside?</value></data>
  <data name="Exp_Intro" xml:space="preserve"><value>NetScanner asks your router (UPnP IGD) for active port forwardings. Each entry is a port that points from the internet to a device on your LAN — a read-only query, nothing is changed.</value></data>
  <data name="Exp_PublicIp" xml:space="preserve"><value>PUBLIC IP</value></data>
  <data name="Exp_Shodan" xml:space="preserve"><value>Check on Shodan ↗</value></data>
